### UAP — Universal Agent Platform

### Master integration blueprint: six platforms, one sovereign agent system

The architectural decision is to retain UAP as the foundation, redesign its entire user experience around Nightly Labs OpenBot, and selectively integrate the strongest capabilities from the other five repositories.

We are not building another Grok Bot clone. We are building a commercially deployable agent platform where every agent can have its own identity, personality, memory, computer, skills, communications, permissions and economic capabilities, while remaining connected to your existing ecosystem.

The six repositories should act as specialized donors, not six competing applications running underneath UAP.

